  "review": {
    "images": "Nine native Nakheel renders from the branded plan books and the Provident-hosted developer waterfront brochure edition. The five project typologies have distinct exterior scenes, plus the Bay Villas aerial and three waterfront villa interiors. The brochure edition is named in the source links.",
    "location": "The developer’s Bay Villas short link resolves to the Bay Villas development marker at 25.312867, 55.327168. The Nakheel plan from Mitchell’s explicitly marks phases 1 and 2 on Island B. Four published travel estimates come from the official corporate page. This page is scoped to the protected Island B project, as confirmed by the corporate link to https://bayvillas.dubaiislands.ae/.",
    "floorPlans": "All 60 drawing sheets in the five Nakheel-branded PDFs were checked. These are 6 beachfront sheets across three six-bedroom units, 5 waterfront, 8 garden, 13 semi-detached and 28 townhouse sheets. Paired and row drawings are identified as shared layouts and have no combined area. Total built-up areas were read from the printed figures. The individual book labels distinguish the Gulf Life and Mitchell’s mirrors."
